- Every doc: `neutral_filter.DEFAULT_FILTER.clean`, email/phone scrub, global normalized-hash dedupe, 13-gram decontam against every string of `data/concepts/eval/*.jsonl`, `data/webeval/*.json`, `data/code_eval/*.jsonl`, `data/chat3/hold_eval.jsonl` (487k grams); code also `build_pycode_corpus.dirty`. Wiki and grok are title-hash sampled from opposite ends so they never share a title.
- `meta.json` (per-source bytes, docs, licenses, stats, credits), `attribution.jsonl.gz` (title+URL for CC BY-SA, URL for FineWeb, repo/path/license for code), `probe.jsonl` (200 docs per source). Tests: `tests/test_clean1_corpus.py` (4 pass).
- `scripts/build_pycode_corpus.py`: `contam()` defaults fixed (humaneval+mbpp+mbpp_holdout; keys canonical, test_list); `names()` and `gate()` factored out and shared. `data/pycode/train.bin` is not license-clean (12% big2 prose) and is not used.

