## 2026-09-13 Firework cloud (skip the residual)

A sentence is a curve on the G2 token chart (G=317). Entry is the prefix as a point cloud (P=8) plus a unique-cell bag. Form is K=12 farthest-point sparks, a 17×17 letter occupancy, and a prefix→completion occurrence table (top 16 destinations per source). Retrieve is Chamfer neighborhood reranked by how often those words fire together; the occurrence cloud is also a form by itself. No `F.linear`, no layer fetch.

`scripts/gf17_firework.py`, `exports/gf17_firework/summary.json`. 410 train / 102 hold. Pack chart+bank+occur+bigram **1102849 B** (0.0117 of pack_g0). Occur cell IoU **0.201**, tok hit **0.316**, word hit **0.309**, bag IoU 0.144. Prefix-gated bigram walk: first-token **0.137**, first-word 0.127, teacher-forced next **0.152**, free walk hit 0.041. Mix spark IoU 0.033. Heuristic PASS on occur (not official G3). Official G3 stays FAIL. The bag of attested words is the silhouette. Ordering those words with a count ridge is still a weak stream.

PMI-excess (`pmi.json`): raw count bag rec/prec **0.316 / 0.342**. PMI>0 top-48 rec/prec **0.013 / 0.013** (rare-token spike). PMI×bigram first-token **0.176**, top-5 **0.294**, teacher-forced next **0.195** (count ridge was 0.137 / 0.152). Excess helps the next-token ridge a little. It kills the bag. Fat all-pair `pmi.pt` deleted; pack stays top-16 per source.

Count-floor / G² / NPMI (`floor.json`): min_n 1–5 is a no-op on aggregated prefix counts. Best bag is still raw count F1 **0.329**. G² F1 0.128, NPMI 0.089. G²×bigram first-token 0.157, top-5 0.304, tf 0.179. Frequency is the silhouette. Excess reweighting does not sharpen it on this bank.

Wide bank 1639/409 (`wide.json`): tok F1 **0.286** (prec 0.247, rec 0.340). First-token 0.142. More rows made the top-48 bag more generic.

Char n-gram (`charord.json`): order-0 first-byte **0.707** / tf 0.168. Order-3 first 0.653 / tf 0.475. Order-4 tf **0.513**. The 0.65 first-byte number is below unigram (the rest often starts with space). Context earns its keep only on the teacher-forced byte walk. Heuristic PASS on char-first was a miss vs order 0.

