- amni/inference/ decode kernels (pass-1 optimized 2026-07-02, tests/test_kernel_opt_pass1.py): int4_group_gemv (LIVE 3B/8B: `_i4p_gemv` v2 KB-wide chunks + per-shape launch heuristics, `int4grp_prefill_packed` dequant+rocBLAS 8.4x prefill, fp16-WMMA dots in `_i4p_gemm`) + nvfp4_gemv (12B: `_e2m1` where-chain not exp2, v2 gemv 2.09x on down_proj, `nvfp4_prefill` dtype-fixed 3.5x) â€” all element_ty stores (bf16 in/out, no svc casts); granite_atex_svc REPACKS unpacked bakes at load (âˆ’40% VRAM) + both svc `_gen` loops enqueue-next-forward-before-`.item()` sync; split-K measured WORSE (rejected); NEXT = hipGraph decode capture (proven 1.91x, v5_4_34) + lm_head quant. GOTCHA: multi-GPU enumerate iGPU gfx1036 + RX 7800 XT gfx1101 + RX 9060 XT gfx1200 (order can change). **Prefer compute arch gfx1200** via `_shared/amni_gpu_env.py` / `amni_serve._gpu_bootstrap` / `bootstrap.pin_discrete_gpu` (`AMNI_GPU_ARCH=gfx1200`, `AMNI_RESERVE_DISPLAY_GPU=1` keeps 7800 free for gaming). Host RAM: `AMNI_RAM_RESERVE_GB=6`. Stack: TheRock multi-arch `torch[device-gfx1200]` 2.12+rocm7.15 â€” **no HSA_OVERRIDE** on native gfx1200. Custom HIP DLLs may still need rebuild with `--offload-arch=gfx1200`. Session ATEX: `../atex/session` + `../scripts/atex_session.py` + `../docs/SESSION_HANDOFF.md`.
