### Storage & Experience
- PTEX atlases (4096x4096 RGBA)
- ATEX (exact LUT) + delta-4plane PNG for nvfp4 low-card codes (4 planes=state bits/deltas, pixel vals offset from 4, nonce=xy coord in picture, lossless recover)
- KnowledgeBase (PTEX pages)
- SemanticPTEXLUT (grid cells)
- GatedPageBank (addressed low-rank residuals)
- CONTEXT-STORE FEDERATION (v1 2026-07-02, all boot-mounted + reboot-persistent): sem_lut lesson bank (experiences/adam_lessons.npz, save-on-teach/writeback, wired to AdamLoop UNCONDITIONALLY) + ATEX AnswerLUT (experiences/adam_lut/lut_index.json, tier-1) + `_LUTEmbedIndex` (in-RAM semantic index, `backfill_lut_index()` re-embeds persisted LUT at every boot â€” batched, idempotent) + PTEX KnowledgeBase pages (experiences/adam_lut/knowledge/*.kb.ptex, mounted by Adam.__init__ via attach_lessons_kb) + ConversationAtlas (per-turn npz slots) + federation packs (learnings/federated/<id>/pack.npz+json + manifest; `migrate_legacy()` converted the 4 orphaned learnings/packs/*.jsonl; `mount_local()` merges every local pack into sem_lut at serve boot, find_match-deduped). Query surface = `mem` skill (per-store-tagged hits: sem_lut soft+cosine, atex_lut exact+embed, conv-atlas recall). Serve boot logs 'federation startup:' + 'lut-index backfill:'.

## Key Mechanisms
- **Reffelt 4-tier**: d3 (coarse) â†’ d0 (lossless). Nonce â†’ RGBA digits.
- **PTEX addressing**: Nonce or semantic cell = location. Retrieved via TMU or LUT.
- **MemoryBus**: Multi-home (ATEX exact + PTEX sem + KB). Verify-after-write. Anti-pattern suppression. Confidence tiers.
- **AdamLoop**: Tiered: exact LUT â†’ sem PTEX â†’ template â†’ cold solve â†’ calc_tool â†’ chord-vote â†’ web. Lessons via PTEX. **Verify-loop (v6.16.0, opt-in `AMNI_VERIFY_LOOP`, default OFF)**: computational answers get adversarial+question-aware VERIFY (require computed final number + magnitude/constant sanity) â†’ diagnose â†’ retry, plus self-consistency voting; verified-storage = cache reads/loose-match/writeback all verify-gated so only verified answers enter/exit the cache. Proven: MMLU-Pro physics 42.5â†’60% (n=40); deployed ~70% fresh computational.
- **Gated learning**: Cosine-keyed low-rank pages on late MLP. Per-domain isolation. Zero backward transfer.
- **Federation**: PRISM via PTEX bundles. PII scrub. Non-personal only.

## Constraints (Non-Negotiable)
- No direct matmul for weights.
- No lossy quantization.
- Base weights preserve cos=1 to trained (additive only via gated/PTEX).
- Learning via PTEX accumulation (storage limit only). **v6.20.236:** `coding_ledger.commit_to_ptex` no longer caps at the last 400 attempts (it silently dropped 49% of the ledger); `max_pairs=0` = uncapped, result reports `dropped`. NOTE: `lessons/coding_attempts_ptex.*` and `lessons/delve_debates_ptex.json` are written but mounted by NOTHING at boot - Adam loads `experiences/adam_lessons.npz`. See docs/ptex_intent_review_2026-08-15.md; mount gated behind AMNI_MOUNT_DELVE_LESSONS (default off).
- AsimovLayer and LawKeeper untouched.

## Self-evolution + benchmarks (v6.20.16â€“22)
- **Pipeline:** `scripts/adam_self_evolve_pipeline.py` â€” LawKeeper â†’ MMLU-Pro/GPQA baseline (bare + AdamLoop) â†’ bank gold misses â†’ re-eval â†’ auto-sinter â†’ `eval_reports/self_evolve_*.json`.
- **Live mount (v6.20.17+):** `federation_store.mount_self_evolve_banks` at serve boot merges `eval_reports/{self_evolve,bench}_bank_*` into sem_lut (cos=1).
- **Sinter (v6.20.18â€“22):** `sinter_self_evolve_banks` / `scripts/adam_sinter.py` fuses banks â†’ `learnings/federated/self-evolve-sintered-*` (direct pack save; n_lessons==unique).
- **Stale heal (v6.20.22):** `adam_keepalive.ps1` restarts serve when healthz version lags `APP_VERSION`.
- **Boot fit (v6.20.24):** federation + self-evolve mounts `defer_fit` then one batch `sem_lut.fit()` (per-pack fit hung boot after get_slice fixed encoder).
