- **Constraint:** cold base identity (cos≈1) + hot writeable substrate (gated pages / dual-address cells); learning via SemanticPTEXLUT / PTEX / gated pages / dual_address_route.
- **Related:** `eval_leaderboard_pipeline.py`, `verify_loop.py`, `learning_daemon` missions, coding ratchet, `answer_sanity`, `adam_self_evolve_research.py`.
- **Doc:** `docs/SELF_EVOLUTION.md`, `docs/SELF_EVOLVE_RESEARCH.md`.
- **Research loop (v6.20.163):** default `AMNI_EVOLVE_MODE=hybrid` runs dual-address research (paths 1 hot-write, 2 sparse runtime, 3 combined) with **mandatory leap creativity** (distant/compose/dark — never local-only). MMLU densify only if `AMNI_EVOLVE_DENSIFY=1`. Substrate: `amni/learning/dual_address_route.py`.
- **Dual-address dedupe + inject rank (v6.20.168):** blake2 stable nonces (no process-salted `hash()` churn); payload body dedupe on write; reports track `unique_useful_*` + `skipped_dup` (growth signal ≠ cell count). `dual_address_live.chat_facts` merges route+token by fact rank (q/a seeds above dark_guide meta); F=ma formula tokens. Tests: `tests/test_dual_address_dedupe_v6_20_168.py`.
- **Bank harvest pairs (v6.20.169):** path1 + `ingest_from_bank_dir` read `lessons.json` `pairs` as `[q,a]` (prior dict-only loop → harvest_n=0). Compact MCQ stems; healthz.research exposes `unique_useful`, `harvest_n`, `skipped_dup`.
- **Stream dual inject + rotate harvest (v6.20.170):** `amni_serve` SSE stream injects `dual_address_live.chat_facts` (parity with agent.chat); research path1 seed-rotates bank + pair windows for cross-subject harvest.
- **OpenAI-compat dual inject (v6.20.171):** `openai_compat._call_adam` injects dual chat_facts for `/v1/*` coding clients (Continue/Cline/Amni-Code).
- **OpenAI-compat self-learning inject (v6.20.221) — CLOSES A REAL BLIND SPOT:** `_call_adam` also injects `pre_response_review.review()` brief + `coding_ledger.brief()` into the system prompt. Until v6.20.221 the whole review substrate (past errors, relevant lessons, prior attempts, the `synthesize()` "you have failed repeatedly — change approach fundamentally" steer) was wired **only** into `AmniAgent.chat()` (`agent.py:922`), i.e. the `/ask` path — so every `/v1/chat/completions` caller generated blind. Symptom that exposed it: Adam repeated a peer-rejected Clay-NS mapping three rounds running in Amni-Delve. Env `AMNI_OAI_REVIEW` (default on) / `AMNI_OAI_REVIEW_K` (3) / `AMNI_OAI_REVIEW_CHARS` (2400). **If you add a new inference entry point, wire pre_response_review into it or it will not learn.**
- **`POST /memory/coding-attempt` (v6.20.221):** torch-free HTTP write path into `coding_ledger.record(...)` for out-of-process callers (standalone Amni-Delve). Exists because `from amni.serve import coding_ledger` chains through `amni/learning/__init__.py` → `auto_learner` → `import torch.nn`, so any caller without torch fails the import — silently, if it wraps in `except Exception`. Prefer this endpoint over `sys.path` bridging. Recall needs no endpoint and no mount: `coding_ledger.recall()` reads `data/coding_attempts.jsonl` off disk via pure-Python `reffelt_tag`.
- **Correction polarity (v6.20.221):** a record is only a *lesson* if `success=False` and the `lesson` field holds the **correction**, not the corrected agent's own answer — `synthesize()` filters on `success is False`. Writing `success=None` turns the ledger into an echo chamber that re-teaches the error.
- **Research test isolation (v6.20.172):** `tests/test_dual_address_research_v6_20_163.py` monkeypatches dual state path so pytest cannot pollute `experiences/dual_address_map.json`.
- **Bank leap-compose (v6.20.173):** path1 after harvest writes one `write_leap_compose` over last two useful bank cells (verified-text payload, not vanity invent) so leap_n occupancy + unique_useful can grow via path3 creativity.
- **MCQ answer compact + compose ops (v6.20.174):** `_compact_a` normalizes letter golds; compose parents seed-rotated; healthz.research exposes `compose_n` + map `leap_n`.
- **Live compact shared (v6.20.175):** `dual_address_live.compact_q`/`compact_a` used by `ingest_pair` + bank harvest; research reuses same helpers so chat corrections and research writes stay format-aligned.
